+//
+// [NIST FIPS 203]: https://doi.org/10.6028/NIST.FIPS.203
+package mlkem
+
+// This package targets security, correctness, simplicity, readability, and
+// reviewability as its primary goals. All critical operations are performed in
+// constant time.
+//
